    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon - Mythic apples are seasonal items. Harvest them while they are available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >############################################################</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular box</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >common - 84%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >uncommon - 14.9998989%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rare - 1%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >epic - 1 in 10 000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >legendary - 1 in 1 000 000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mythic - 1 in 10 000 000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special box</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >common - 40%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >uncommon - 45%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rare - 13.999989%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >epic - 1%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >legendary - 1 in 100 000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mythic - 1 in 1 000 000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >############################################################</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop rates are subject to change</p></p><br><h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf4f Join Our Discord!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want the inside scoop on <i>Hungry for Applez?</i> Come hang out with us on Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find exclusive game insights, behind-the-scenes content, and sneak peeks at rare apple designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742120/extras/1c9a7ad6e9f5e4a0ebd4d701b18469e2.avif?t=1750811919\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry for apples!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to tap your way to the top in <i>Applez</i>, a satisfying clicker game where every click brings you closer to the ultimate harvest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click apples to collect them, then trade up for rarer, shinier, and juicier apples! From Common to Mythic, each tier unlocks a new level of prestige. Whether you're grinding solo or trading with other players through the marketplace, the orchard is always full of opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, addictive clicker gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and upgrade apples through exchanges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading system to boost your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rarity tiers to chase and brag about</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal apple events and limited-time items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How rare can your orchard grow? Start clicking and find out!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry for apples!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to tap your way to the top in <i>Applez</i>, a satisfying clicker game where every click brings you closer to the ultimate harvest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click apples to collect them, then trade up for rarer, shinier, and juicier apples! From Common to Mythic, each tier unlocks a new level of prestige. Whether you're grinding solo or trading with other players through the marketplace, the orchard is always full of opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, addictive clicker gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and upgrade apples through exchanges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading system to boost your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rarity tiers to chase and brag about</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal apple events and limited-time items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How rare can your orchard grow? Start clicking and find out!</p>",
